{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "GeoMeasure API",
    "description": "Production-quality REST API for geospatial measurements.\n\n## Features\n* **Geodesic accuracy**: Powered by `pyproj.Geod` over the WGS84 ellipsoid.\n* **Multi-format support**: GeoJSON, KML, KMZ, GPX, Shapefile, GeoPackage, CSV, and GeoTIFF.\n* **Async jobs**: Process gigabyte-scale files safely in the background.\n* **Security**: XXE protection, zip-bomb prevention, and path traversal guards built-in.\n",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Ishan Makkar",
      "url": "https://github.com/iishanmakkar/GeoMeasure-API",
      "email": "ishanmakkar651@gmail.com"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT License",
      "identifier": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
